<td style='text-align: center; font-weight: bold;'>1</td>
<td><span class='risk-severe'>严重风险</span></td>
<td>24小时内</td>
<td>立即修复，必要时停机维护</td></tr>
<tr>
<td style='text-align: center; font-weight: bold;'>2</td>
<td><span class='risk-high'>高风险</span></td>
<td>72小时内</td>
